flowchart TD
MOO_Optimizer["**MOO Optimizer**<br/>NSGA2 controller"]
BufferProblem["**Optimization Problem**<br/>Decision variables capacities for 6 buffers {1-10}<br/>Objectives: minimize wip and maximize throughput"]
Inputs["**Inputs**<br/>Buffer capacities for 6 buffers<br/>cap_post_loading cap_post_conveyor cap_post_washing cap_pre_press1 cap_pre_press2 cap_post_press12"]
Evaluator["**Evaluator**<br/>evaluate_single_individual<br/>aggregates replication results"]
Parallel_Pool["**Parallel Pool**<br/>Multiprocessing workers {n_cores}<br/>distributes individuals"]
Simulation_Runner["**Simulation Runner**<br/>run_simulation_with_caps<br/>constructs simpy model with given caps<br/>returns throughput and wip per replication"]
Production_Model["**Production Model**<br/>Machines and DelayBuffers<br/>process logic computes WIP and energy"]
Pareto_Front["**Pareto Front**<br/>Non dominated configurations<br/>trade off wip and throughput"]
Results_Exporter["**Results Exporter**<br/>export_history_to_csv<br/>saves generation history and objectives to CSV"]

MOO_Optimizer --> BufferProblem
BufferProblem --> Inputs
BufferProblem --> Evaluator
Inputs --> Evaluator
Evaluator --> Parallel_Pool
Parallel_Pool --> Simulation_Runner
Simulation_Runner --> Production_Model
Production_Model --> Simulation_Runner
Simulation_Runner --> Evaluator
Evaluator --> MOO_Optimizer
MOO_Optimizer --> Pareto_Front
MOO_Optimizer --> Results_Exporter
Results_Exporter --> Pareto_Front